flowchart LR
 _Prelude_(["Escort the cartel&#39;s team and help them retrieve their cash from the seized plane."])
 _A1_(["The team pulls up outside the hangar and exits the vehicle casually."])
 _A1_1_(["The guard comes out to greet them with a surly demeanor, insisting this hangar is restricted."])
 _A1_C1_{"Hustler claims they&#39;re here to prep the plane for auction."}
 _A1_C1F_["The guard stops the crew and insists he&#39;s heard nothing about this."]
 _A1_C2_{"Enforcer steps forward to assert his authority, demanding they be let in."}
 _A1_C2P_["The threat of #quot;unpleasant complications#quot; pressures the guard into stepping aside."]
 _A2_(["Disguised as cleaners, the cartel couriers step out and follow the team inside."])
 _A2_1_(["Hustler watches the guard while the others move the maintenance stairs into position."])
 _A2_2_(["Engineer unlocks the cabin door, allowing the couriers to enter."])
 _A2_3_(["Hustler notices the guard is starting to sweat—he&#39;s hiding something."])
 _A2_4_(["The couriers struggle to find the cash and ask Engineer for help."])
 _A2_C1_{"Engineer uses his engineering knowhow to narrow down the search."}
 _A2_C1F_["Engineer cuts open seats and pries off panels but finds nothing."]
 _A2_C2_{"Enforcer is brought in to aid Engineer and quicken the search."}
 _A2_C2F_["After searching high and low, the crew comes up short yet again."]
 _A2_C3_{"Enforcer and Engineer split up, each working with one of the couriers."}
 _A2_C3P_["Finally, Engineer discovers some cash stored beneath the avionics bay."]
 _A3_(["Engineer removes the panels using the drill and passes the money to the couriers."])
 _A3_1_(["Another large deposit is found stored in a bulkhead insulation cavity."])
 _A3_2_(["After a thorough search of the aircraft, one stash remains elusive."])
 _A3_3_(["The couriers ask Enforcer to interrogate the security guard to see if he knows anything."])
 _A3_C1_{"Enforcer enters the office and starts questioning the guard."}
 _A3_C1F_["Despite Enforcer&#39;s threats, the guard claims ignorance."]
 _A3_C2_{"Hustler tries to trick the guard into revealing what he really knows."}
 _A3_C2P_["Hustler tells the guard he’s been ratted on, and the truth about the cash spills out."]
 _A4_(["He claims he only found one bag and swears he didn&#39;t know it belonged to the cartel."])
 _A4_1_(["Enforcer asks the guard if he told anyone else about the money."])
 _A4_2_(["Weeping, he admits he told his friends in the T.C.P.D., and they&#39;re on their way."])
 _A4_2_Cont_(["Enforcer rushes back to warn the others that the cops are coming."])
 _A4_3_(["Improvising a plan, Engineer tells the crew to pile up some junk near the right engine."])
 _A4_4_(["Meanwhile, Engineer enters the cockpit and tries to figure out the controls."])
 _A4_C1_{"With only a drop of fuel remaining, Engineer attempts to start the right engine."}
 _A4_C1P_["The engine whirs to life, flinging dust across the hangar floor."]
 _A5_(["As the cops enter, Enforcer and Hustler throw items into the jet stream."])
 _A5_1_(["A wrench makes contact with one cop, caving in his face."])
 _A5_2_(["Enforcer unleashes a canister of kerosene over the officers."])
 _A5_3_(["The cops panic as they are drenched with flammable fuel."])
 _A5_4_(["Engineer cuts the engine and the couriers move in on the cops."])
 _A5_5_(["Brandishing a lighter, one courier threatens to start a barbecue and light the pigs up."])
 _A5_6_(["Undeterred, the cops draw their weapons and refuse to back down."])
 _A5_C1_{"Hustler steps in to negotiate a deal with the police officers."}
 _A5_C1P_["The cops agree to let the crew leave for a 50% share."]
 _A6_(["The couriers bring the cash to the office, the situation becoming tense."])
 _A6_1_(["As the cash is counted and divided up, the crew exchanges knowing looks."])
 _A6_C1_{"Enforcer tries to grab one of the cops and take him hostage with a nail gun."}
 _A6_C1P_["Enforcer fires a nail into the cop&#39;s leg, and the pigs finally give up their claim."]
 _A7_(["The couriers and crew pack the cash into the car."])
 _A7_1_(["Enforcer demands the last stash of cash from the guard."])
 _A7_2_(["The guard fetches the cash from his locker and hands it to Engineer."])
 _A7_3_(["Outside, Enforcer blasts another nail into the cop, dumps him, and jumps in the car."])
 _A7S_(["The team speeds off with the couriers, receiving a large share of the loot as reward."])
 _A1_C2F_["Enforcer&#39;s attempt to intimidate the guard makes him tetchy."]
 _A1_C3_{"Enforcer gestures toward Engineer&#39;s drill as proof they&#39;re here to work."}
 _A1_C3P_["The guard believes the team&#39;s story and lets them through."]
 _A2_C2P_["Enforcer and Engineer discover a cash deposit within the bulkhead insulation."]
 _A2_9_(["Another stash of cash is discovered beneath the avionics bay and accessed with a drill."])
 _A4_C1F_["Engineer accidentally starts both engines, draining the last reserves of fuel."]
 _A4_5_(["Having failed with Plan A, Engineer exits the plane to look for another solution."])
 _A4_6_(["The crew members start arming themselves with whatever tools they can find."])
 _B4_1_(["Enforcer sloshes kerosene around the inside of the aircraft, setting a trap."])
 _B4_2_(["Enforcer hides with Engineer, instructing him to light the flare on his mark."])
 _B4_C1_{"As the cops enter the plane, Enforcer gives Engineer the signal."}
 _B4_C1P_["Engineer tosses the flare into the cabin, setting the cops alight."]
 _B5_(["With the interruption dealt with, the team&#39;s focus turns to the cash."])
 _B5_C1_{"Hustler confronts the cartel, demanding a better payday for their exertions."}
 _B5_C1P_["Hustler manages to convince the couriers to give them a higher cut."]
 _B6_(["The couriers count out their share and hand over the rest to the team."])
 _B6_1_(["Engineer asks about the missing money, and the couriers confront the guard."])
 _B6_2_(["He screams as they torture him, and Enforcer decides it&#39;s time to bail."])
 _B6S_(["The crew slips away with full pockets and no complaints from the cartel."])
 _A2_C1P_["Engineer finds most of the cash stored under the floor panels of the avionics bay."]
 _A3_C1P_["After an intense interrogation, the guard admits he took some of the smuggled cash."]
 _B4_C1F_["Engineer reacts too late, giving the cops time to exit the plane."]
 _B4_C2_{"Enforcer and Hustler charge at the cops to attack them."}
 _B4_C2F_["Hustler and Engineer are gunned down before they can land a single blow."]
 _B4_3_(["The cartel operatives return fire while Enforcer tries to run."])
 _B4F_(["Enforcer makes a narrow escape, the only positive from a disaster of a mission."])
 _A1_C1P_["Hustler confidently tells the guard to call his boss to verify, and he steps aside."]
 _A6_C1F_["The guard sees Enforcer coming and kneecaps him."]
 _A6_2_(["Engineer grabs the nail gun and peppers the cops with projectiles."])
 _A6_3_(["The officers back into the office and barricade the door, trapping the team in the hangar."])
 _A6_C2_{"Engineer tries to override the hangar’s motorized gate controls."}
 _A6_C2P_["The gate slides open, allowing Hustler to rush to the vehicle."]
 _A8_(["The cops fire on the car as Hustler reverses to fetch the others."])
 _A8_1_(["Enforcer and the loot are loaded into the vehicle by the couriers."])
 _A8S_(["Having secured most of the cash, the crew beats a hasty exit."])
 _A3_C2F_["The guard is wise to Hustler&#39;s tricks and refuses to change his story."]
 _A3_4_(["The crew hears a car pull up outside, and a wry smile flashes across the guard&#39;s face."])
 _A3_5_(["Realizing someone else is here for the cash, the crew members start arming themselves."])
 _B4_(["Hustler picks up a nail gun and Engineer grabs a flare."])
 _B4_C2P_["Through a combo of knockouts and nail guns, the crew manages to take the corrupt cops down."]
 _A6_C2F_["Engineer&#39;s failure to open the gate draws laughter from the cops."]
 _A6_4_(["Hustler grabs a canister of kerosene and stands over the cash bags."])
 _A6_C3_{"Hustler gives the cops a choice between letting the crew go or watching the cash burn."}
 _A6_C3F_["When Hustler starts burning the cash, the couriers lose their cool."]
 _A6_5_(["They beat Hustler and Engineer half to death and negotiate with the cops directly."])
 _A6F_(["The crew is left behind as the couriers escape with a half share of their smuggled fortune."])
 _B5_C1F_["The couriers accuse Hustler of being greedy, and an argument erupts."]
 _B5_1_(["When Hustler uses a slur, he&#39;s kneecapped by one of the cartel members."])
 _B5_2_(["Enforcer calms things down and apologizes for Hustler&#39;s offensive behavior."])
 _B5_3_(["Having insulted the cartel, the couriers insist the crew&#39;s share has been forfeited."])
 _B5F_(["Wary of escalating the situation, the crew decides to back down and leave without payment."])
 _A5_C1F_["The cops turn down Hustler&#39;s offer, believing it to be a trick."]
 _A5_C2_{"Enforcer tells the courier to drop the lighter and burn everything."}
 _A5_C2F_["The courier refuses to play along, negotiating with the cops directly."]
 _A5_C3_{"Enforcer insists that Gusti Mboten Sare is not a faction to be messed with."}
 _A5_C3P_["The couriers relent, and a deal is struck between all three parties."]
 _A5_9_(["The cash is counted and divided in the hangar as the crew watches on."])
 _A5_10_(["One of the couriers discreetly pockets an extra share, angering the cops."])
 _A5_11_(["Enforcer steps forward and tries to calm things down."])
 _A5_12_(["One cop draws his gun and blasts a hole through Enforcer&#39;s leg."])
 _A5_13_(["Engineer grabs a nail gun and tries to fend off the angry police officers."])
 _A5_14_(["The cops barricade themselves in the office, trapping the crew in the hangar."])
 _A5_C3F_["The couriers and cops laugh, claiming Lusty Lizards ain&#39;t what it used to be."]
 _A5_7_(["Furious at being cut out of the deal, Enforcer punches one of the couriers."])
 _A5_8_(["The cops help the cartel operatives batter the crew into submission."])
 _A5F_(["The corrupt cops and couriers divide the loot among themselves, leaving the team to bleed out."])
 _A5_C2P_["At the last minute, the cops agree to negotiate, accepting a 50% share to back down."]
 _A6_C3P_["Greed wins out, and the cops accept a 50-50 share."]
 _A9_(["Hustler&#39;s clever sleight of hand sees him screw the cops out of an extra 10%."])
 _A9_1_(["The cops open the gate and allow the crew to leave at gunpoint."])
 _A9S_(["A last-minute deal sees the team walk away with more than half of the smuggled cash."])
 _A2_C3F_["Despite their best efforts, the crew fails to find any cash on the airplane."]
 _A2_5_(["The couriers become irate and confront the guard, accusing him of stealing the money."])
 _A2_6_(["He draws a weapon and barricades himself in the office, taking Hustler hostage."])
 _A2_7_(["Enforcer breaks down the door and charges at the guard, taking a shot to the gut."])
 _A2_8_(["The couriers help Engineer overpower the guard and knock him out."])
 _A2F_(["After several mistakes, the team is told to leave, the couriers deciding to handle it themselves."])
 _A1_C3F_["Feeling threatened, the guard slams the door, locks it tight, and calls for backup."]
 _A1F_(["With airport security on its way, the crew abandons the mission to avoid a firefight."])

